# Supabase MCP

- Use only the project MCP server named `hexy-supabase` from this repo `.cursor/mcp.json`.
- Never add Supabase to `~/.cursor/mcp.json`.
- Never call a server named `supabase`.
- Never use `https://mcp.supabase.com/mcp` without `project_ref`.
- Write SQL to `supabase/migrations/` before `apply_migration`.
- Edge source of truth is `supabase/functions/<name>/index.ts`. MCP deploy is the ship path only.
- Keep `storage` in the MCP features query. Hosted MCP disables Storage unless listed.
